{"id":"aa655f22-d9d1-4308-aba8-588f50620ff2","revision":0,"last_node_id":30,"last_link_id":28,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[20,80],"size":[420,470],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"choose file to upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"IMAGE","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[2,7]},{"localized_name":"MASK","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","links":null}],"title":"Reference image","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"LoadImage","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.38.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Iridescent Cybernetic Guardian.png","image"]},{"id":3,"type":"LoadBackgroundRemovalModel","pos":[20,712],"size":[420,60],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"bg_removal_name","name":"bg_removal_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"bg_removal_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"bg_model","name":"bg_model","type":"BACKGROUND_REMOVAL","links":[1]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"LoadBackgroundRemovalModel","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.38.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["birefnet.safetensors"]},{"id":4,"type":"RemoveBackground","pos":[20,812],"size":[420,50],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"bg_removal_model","name":"bg_removal_model","type":"BACKGROUND_REMOVAL","link":1},{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":2}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"mask","name":"mask","type":"MASK","links":[8]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"RemoveBackground","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.38.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":5,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,1040],"size":[460,560],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Read me · Inputs","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 1 · Your inputs\n**Mesh:** type the path into **UltraTex Load Mesh**: a full path like `C:\\models\\volt.glb` or a path relative to `ComfyUI/input`. GLB, OBJ and PLY work. Trellis2, Pixal3D, Hunyuan or your own sculpt are all fine.\n\n**Reference image:** one front view of the object. Best: the exact image you generated the mesh from, so it lines up.\n\n**Background:** you don't need a transparent PNG. **BiRefNet** cuts the object out and Prep is set to `mask_meaning = foreground`. If you would rather use your PNG's alpha: connect Load Image **MASK** to Prep `reference_mask` instead and set `mask_meaning = background (LoadImage)`.\n\n**Text and logos** only come out clean if they are sharp and readable in the reference, ideally on the front."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":7,"type":"CLIPLoader","pos":[540,200],"size":[440,106],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip_name","name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"type","name":"type","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"type"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"device","name":"device","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"device"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","links":[6]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPLoader","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.38.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors","flux2","default"]},{"id":8,"type":"VAELoader","pos":[540,345],"size":[440,60],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"vae_name","name":"vae_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vae_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","links":[3]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAELoader","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.38.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["flux2-vae.safetensors"]},{"id":9,"type":"UltraTexForegroundDecoder","pos":[540,445],"size":[440,60],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":3},{"localized_name":"decoder_name","name":"decoder_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"decoder_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","links":[13,18]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UltraTexForegroundDecoder","cnr_id":"ultratex","ver":"8137da52ed8352305cb7825b39c36a250bf2507a","aux_id":"visualbruno/ComfyUI-UltraTex","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["ultratex_flux2_decoder.pt"]},{"id":10,"type":"UltraTexLoraLoader","pos":[540,545],"size":[440,82],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":4},{"localized_name":"lora_name","name":"lora_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"strength","name":"strength","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[12]}],"title":"UltraTex Load LoRA (Albedo)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UltraTexLoraLoader","cnr_id":"ultratex","ver":"8137da52ed8352305cb7825b39c36a250bf2507a","aux_id":"visualbruno/ComfyUI-UltraTex","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["ultratex_flux2.safetensors",1]},{"id":11,"type":"UltraTexLoraLoader","pos":[540,665],"size":[440,82],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":5},{"localized_name":"lora_name","name":"lora_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"strength","name":"strength","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[17]}],"title":"UltraTex Load LoRA (Metallic-Roughness)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UltraTexLoraLoader","cnr_id":"ultratex","ver":"8137da52ed8352305cb7825b39c36a250bf2507a","aux_id":"visualbruno/ComfyUI-UltraTex","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["ultratex_flux2_mr.safetensors",1]},{"id":12,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[540,785],"size":[440,100],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":6},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[14,19]}],"title":"Empty prompt (leave empty)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.38.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[""]},{"id":13,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[520,1040],"size":[480,560],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Read me · Models","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 2 · Models\nNothing to change here after running the installer.\n\n- The two **UltraTex Load LoRA** nodes are required. The stock *Load LoRA* node can't read these files and fails **silently**.\n- First run, check the console for **both** LoRAs:\n  `UltraTex LoRA ... (peft format): N layers patched of N`\n- The prompt stays **empty**. UltraTex only listens to the image.\n- No negative prompt is connected on purpose: with an empty prompt, CFG would only double the render time."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":14,"type":"UltraTexPrep","pos":[1080,80],"size":[380,220],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"reference_image","name":"reference_image","type":"IMAGE","link":7},{"localized_name":"reference_mask","name":"reference_mask","shape":7,"type":"MASK","link":8},{"localized_name":"trimesh","name":"trimesh","shape":7,"type":"TRIMESH","link":9},{"localized_name":"mesh_path","name":"mesh_path","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"mesh_path"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"render_size","name":"render_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"render_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"atlas_size","name":"atlas_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"atlas_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"uv_mode","name":"uv_mode","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"uv_mode"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"reference_alignment","name":"reference_alignment","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"reference_alignment"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"mask_meaning","name":"mask_meaning","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"mask_meaning"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"prep","name":"prep","type":"ULTRATEX_PREP","links":[15,20,22]},{"localized_name":"normal_views","name":"normal_views","type":"IMAGE","links":[11]},{"localized_name":"reference","name":"reference","type":"IMAGE","links":[10]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UltraTexPrep","cnr_id":"ultratex","ver":"8137da52ed8352305cb7825b39c36a250bf2507a","aux_id":"visualbruno/ComfyUI-UltraTex","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["",4096,4096,"comfy_gpu","fit_front_silhouette","foreground"]},{"id":17,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1060,1040],"size":[420,560],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Read me · Prep","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 3 · Prep\nNormalizes the mesh, unwraps UVs and renders the 6 normal views.\n\n- `uv_mode`: **comfy_gpu** (~6 s for 500k faces). **keep_existing** if your mesh already has clean UVs, e.g. from Blender or Maya. **xatlas** is CPU-only and slow (minutes).\n- **Quick check:** the *Reference check* preview should show your object filling the mesh silhouette **edge to edge**. If it's small or shifted, the mask is wrong."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":18,"type":"UltraTexSampler","pos":[1560,80],"size":[330,420],"flags":{},"order":18,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":12},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":13},{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":14},{"localized_name":"prep","name":"prep","type":"ULTRATEX_PREP","link":15},{"localized_name":"negative","name":"negative","shape":7,"type":"CONDITIONING","link":null},{"localized_name":"init_views","name":"init_views","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"keep_mask","name":"keep_mask","shape":7,"type":"MASK","link":null},{"localized_name":"resolution","name":"resolution","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"resolution"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"steps","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"guidance","name":"guidance","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"guidance"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"drop_background_tokens","name":"drop_background_tokens","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"drop_background_tokens"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"memory_factor","name":"memory_factor","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"memory_factor"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"attention","name":"attention","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"attention"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"sparse_topk","name":"sparse_topk","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"sparse_topk"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"token_chunk","name":"token_chunk","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"token_chunk"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"denoise","name":"denoise","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"denoise"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"views","name":"views","type":"IMAGE","links":[23]},{"localized_name":"masks","name":"masks","type":"MASK","links":null},{"localized_name":"atlas","name":"atlas","type":"IMAGE","links":[16]}],"title":"UltraTex Sampler · Albedo","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UltraTexSampler","cnr_id":"ultratex","ver":"8137da52ed8352305cb7825b39c36a250bf2507a","aux_id":"visualbruno/ComfyUI-UltraTex","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[1024,25,12345,"fixed",4,true,0,"ultratex_sparse",0.2,8192,1]},{"id":20,"type":"UltraTexSampler","pos":[1560,540],"size":[330,420],"flags":{},"order":19,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":17},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":18},{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":19},{"localized_name":"prep","name":"prep","type":"ULTRATEX_PREP","link":20},{"localized_name":"negative","name":"negative","shape":7,"type":"CONDITIONING","link":null},{"localized_name":"init_views","name":"init_views","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"keep_mask","name":"keep_mask","shape":7,"type":"MASK","link":null},{"localized_name":"resolution","name":"resolution","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"resolution"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"steps","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"guidance","name":"guidance","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"guidance"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"drop_background_tokens","name":"drop_background_tokens","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"drop_background_tokens"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"memory_factor","name":"memory_factor","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"memory_factor"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"attention","name":"attention","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"attention"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"sparse_topk","name":"sparse_topk","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"sparse_topk"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"token_chunk","name":"token_chunk","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"token_chunk"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"denoise","name":"denoise","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"denoise"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"views","name":"views","type":"IMAGE","links":[24]},{"localized_name":"masks","name":"masks","type":"MASK","links":null},{"localized_name":"atlas","name":"atlas","type":"IMAGE","links":[21]}],"title":"UltraTex Sampler · Metallic-Roughness","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UltraTexSampler","cnr_id":"ultratex","ver":"8137da52ed8352305cb7825b39c36a250bf2507a","aux_id":"visualbruno/ComfyUI-UltraTex","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[1024,25,12345,"fixed",4,true,0,"ultratex_sparse",0.2,8192,1]},{"id":22,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1540,1040],"size":[800,620],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Read me · Painting","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 4 · Paint the 6 views\nFLUX.2 Klein base + the UltraTex LoRA paints front, left, back, right, top and bottom, consistent with each other.\n\n| Setting | Tests | Finals |\n|---|---|---|\n| `resolution` (albedo) | **1024** | **2048** |\n| `resolution` (MR) | 1024 | 1024 |\n| `steps` | 25 | 25 |\n\n- Keep the **same seed** on both samplers.\n- **2048** takes roughly 4× as long as 1024.\n- `attention = ultratex_sparse` needs Triton. Without it, switch to `comfy_default`, which is slower but gives the same result.\n- Out of memory? Lower `token_chunk` to 4096 or raise `memory_factor`.\n\n### Metallic-roughness (PBR)\nSame seed, same reference, but with the **MR LoRA**. Its output looks like flat colored maps, not a painted character. If you see a painted character here, the MR LoRA didn't load.\n\nThe bake writes one glTF **ORM** texture: **G = roughness, B = metallic**. MR maps are low-detail, so this sampler can stay at **1024** even when albedo runs at 2048."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":25,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2400,1120],"size":[580,360],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Read me · Bake","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## Bake & output\nProjects all views onto the UVs and saves to `ComfyUI/output/UltraTex/`:\n- a textured **GLB** (also shown in Preview 3D)\n- the **albedo** and **ORM** PNGs\n\n`texture_size` is the final texture resolution (2048 is a good default). It is independent of the sampler resolution."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":26,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-760],"size":[1460,720],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"START HERE · UltraTex Standard","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# UltraTex · Standard (6 views + PBR)\n**PixelArtistry** · nodes by **visualbruno** (ComfyUI-UltraTex, MIT) · model by the **UltraTex** team (SIGGRAPH Asia 2026)\n\nPaints a **2K texture** for any untextured mesh from **one reference image**. No text prompt needed. Six cameras, plus a metallic-roughness pass for PBR. **Start here:** it's the fastest and works on most objects.\n\n### How to use\n1. **Group 1:** set your mesh path and load your reference image.\n2. Press **Run**.\n3. Open the GLB in **Preview 3D**, or grab the files from `output/UltraTex/`.\n\n### Settings that matter\n| Setting | Where | Value |\n|---|---|---|\n| Albedo resolution | Sampler · Albedo | 1024 for tests, 2048 for finals |\n| UV unwrap | Prep · uv_mode | comfy_gpu, or keep_existing for your own UVs |\n| Texture size | Bake · texture_size | 2048 |\n| VRAM | – | the fp8 model alone is ~9 GB, tested on 16 GB cards. For 6–8 GB use the GGUF workflow |\n\n### Models (the installer puts them in place)\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| `flux-2-klein-base-9b-fp8.safetensors` | `models/diffusion_models` |\n| `qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` | `models/text_encoders` |\n| `flux2-vae.safetensors` | `models/vae` |\n| `ultratex_flux2.safetensors` | `models/loras` |\n| `ultratex_flux2_mr.safetensors` | `models/loras` |\n| `ultratex_flux2_decoder.pt` | `models/ultratex` |\n| `birefnet.safetensors` | `models/background_removal` |\n\n**Must be Klein BASE 9B.** The normal (distilled) Klein 9B does not work with UltraTex.\n\n### License\n- UltraTex code and nodes: MIT.\n- FLUX.2 Klein base 9B: FLUX Non-Commercial License v2.1. BFL claims no ownership of your outputs and allows using them for any purpose, including commercial, except training a competing model. Running the model itself is licensed for non-commercial use, so check https://bfl.ai/licensing before client or production work.\n"],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":6,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[540,80],"size":[440,82],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"unet_name","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"weight_dtype","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[4,5]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UNETLoader","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.38.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors","default"]},{"id":2,"type":"UltraTexLoadMesh","pos":[20,590],"size":[420,82],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"glb_path","name":"glb_path","type":"STRING",